<TD VALIGN=top><IMG SRC="image/Arista.jpg" WIDTH=64 HEIGHT=64></TD>
<TD STYLE="padding-left: 12px" VALIGN=top>
TimerMod was started back in August 2002 as a simple tick timer that I created for timing mezzes. Since then, additional types of timers
and many new features have been added, thanks to the countless users who have provided me with valuable feedback.
<BR><BR>
The TimerMod utility is now a web-based XML generator with many configurable options, allowing players to fully customize timers
for their specific needs and preferences. Each file package is dynamically generated by the server upon download, based on options selected by the user.
<BR><BR>
I hope you find the timers useful. Safe travels in EverQuest!
<BR><BR>
<B>Arista</B><BR>
Level 57 Erudite Enchanter<BR>
<I>The Seventh Hammer</I>
